# Package catalog: platforms provider package [option]
# Platforms: darwin, ubuntu, fedora, arch (includes Omarchy).
# Providers: native (apt/dnf/pacman), brew, cask, tap, uv.
# Options: unlinked for brew; trusted for tap. No inline comments.
# Keep shared packages on one row; distro-specific names need separate rows.
# Consumed by install.sh and homebrew/Brewfile. See docs/installation.md.

